  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This makes 6 naans and takes about 35 minutes plus rising. The dough needs to rise, so give it the full time. Cook the naans on a very hot pan for soft, bubbly bread."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Slap the rolled dough onto a screaming hot pan so it blisters and puffs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
