          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Method"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Mix the flour, sugar and a pinch of salt. Stir in the yoghurt and warm milk to a soft dough."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Knead for 8 minutes, then cover and leave to rise for 90 minutes."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Divide into 6 pieces and roll each into a teardrop shape."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Heat a frying pan until very hot. Lay a naan in and cook until it bubbles up."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Flip and cook the other side until charred in spots."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Brush with "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ghee",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                        "attrs": {
                          "termSlug": "ghee"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and crushed garlic and serve warm."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "troubleshooter",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
            {
              "symptom": "The naan is flat",
              "cause": "The dough did not rise",
              "fix": "Give it longer to rise in a warm spot."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "The naan is hard",
              "cause": "It was cooked too long",
              "fix": "Cook each side quickly on a very hot pan."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "The naan stuck",
              "cause": "The pan was dry and too cool",
              "fix": "Use a hot, well seasoned pan and a little oil."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where this dish lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Naan is the bread of celebration meals. It is softer and richer than chapati. A hot tandoor gives it char, but a hot pan works at home. Brush it with garlic butter for a treat. It is made to mop up rich curries."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
